{"tail":"הַלֲלוּיָהּ שִׁירוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" שִׁיר חָדָשׁ תְּהִלָּתוֹ בִּקְהַל חֲסִידִים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִשְׂמַח יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּעֹשָׂיו בְּנֵי־צִיּוֹן יָגִילוּ בְמַלְכָּם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יְהַלֲלוּ שְׁמוֹ בְמָחוֹל בְּתֹף וְכִנּוֹר יְזַמְּרוּ־לוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי־רוֹצֶה "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" בְּעַמּוֹ יְפָאֵר עֲנָוִים בִּישׁוּעָה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יַעְלְזוּ חֲסִידִים בְּכָבוֹד יְרַנְּנוּ עַל־מִשְׁכְּבוֹתָם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"רוֹמְמוֹת אֵל בִּגְרוֹנָם וְחֶרֶב פִּיפִיּוֹת בְּיָדָם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לַעֲשׂוֹת נְקָמָה בַגּוֹיִם תּוֹכֵחוֹת בַּלְאֻמִּים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֶאְסֹר מַלְכֵיהֶם בְּזִקִּים וְנִכְבְּדֵיהֶם בְּכַבְלֵי בַרְזֶל: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לַעֲשׂוֹת בָּהֶם מִשְׁפָּט כָּתוּב הָדָר הוּא לְכָל־חֲסִידָיו הַלֲלוּיָהּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
